"The Palace of Unbreaking is a scarily dedicated Artonan body that preserves wordchains."
"It holds wordchains to be the original magic and restricts fragile chains to responsible users."
"Among Avowed only Chainers may work there; Artonan members may teach once past novice echelons."
"It will not let Chainers bestow chains on unwilling people, and may send one to correct misuse."
"Its members say: 'We all make sacrifices for the Unbreaking.'"
"The Grand Senate affirmed its value; some of the strongest chains exist only thanks to it."
"A chain link, an inch-long silver rounded rectangle, is its symbolic reward, strung and carried."
"It gives some members Opposite stones, and receives copies of Chainers' student ledgers."
